<title>UK: DNIB sets 150 mln Swiss franc six-year bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 150 mln Swiss franc six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102	 PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    SWISS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
